Package: glmpa
Title: Power Approximation for Generalized Linear Mixed Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Carlie", "Prinster", , "gapeach292@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "YOUR-ORCID-ID"))
Description: Functions to approximate power of generalized linear mixed
    models using the probability distribution method (PDM), via the blme
    or glmmTMB packages to fix random variance components.
